
 kevlar vest        The kevlar vest is made of a light, tough fabric that
                    affords protection against attacks when used.

 energy shield      The energy shield is a small unit which establishes
                    a protective shield around the operator.  This shield
                    provides ample protection against attacks, but is
                    weakened each time the shield deflects a blow.  Battery
                    packs may be used to recharge the shield.

 flare              The flare will provide temporary illumination in an
                    otherwise dark room.

 jetpack            The jetpack, when used, allows the operator to defy
                    the laws of gravity.  However, it burns fuel rapidly
                    and must be recharged with rocket fuel when stores are
                    depleted.

 construction kit   The construction kit contains materials and tools
                    needed for any construction project.

 machine parts      Machine parts are required for any construction of
                    machinery.  Larger and more complex machinery will
                    require increasing numbers of parts to construct.

 weapon parts       Weapon parts are required for the construction of
                    weapons (like you didn't know).

 light-amp goggles  These goggles amplify the available light to allow
                    vision in almost complete darkness.

 gas mask           The gas mask, when used, affords protection against
                    tear gas clouds.

 stim pack          The stim pack contains a syringe and serum which boosts
                    a player's strength, dexterity and constitution for a
                    short time.

